 "captions": {
  "n": 29,
  "texts": [
   "A lot of people don't",
   "know this, but Grok is",
   "slowly becoming one of",
   "the top three contenders",
   "in the AI space, both",
   "in the model side and",
   "in the application side.",
   "In the last month, they",
   "have shipped over",
   "24 major features to their",
   "Grok Build application.",
   "Now, this includes",
   "things such as",
   "an agent dashboard,",
   "multi-modal and",
   "multi-agent workflows,",
   "deep research workflows,",
   "just to name a few.",
   "Now, the team over at",
   "SpaceX AI is shipping so",
   "much, it's literally hard to",
   "keep track of everything.",
   "Now, follow for",
   "more AI news,",
   "videos, and tutorials",
   "each and every",
   "single day,",
   "and catch you",
   "on the next one."
  ],
  "widest_px": 753.2
